#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""mind-nerve auto-router — ONE CLI-agnostic hook.

Fired on UserPromptSubmit / SessionStart by any CLI that speaks the
Claude-compatible hook protocol (claude, codex, gemini, grok, kimi, qwen).

Pipeline:
  0. INTENT GATE (before any embedding). Evaluate only the newest USER turn,
     with injected system prompts / tool output / notification blobs stripped,
     and skip routing entirely for text that is not a request. See
     `intent_gate` — this is the load-bearing filter, NOT the score threshold.
  1. Query the mind-nerve-routed daemon over a UNIX socket.
     (NOT the MCP process's own runtime — see mind_nerve/daemon_client.py for
      why the two must not be separate catalogs.)
  2. DEDUP routes by name across `source_repo` — the catalog carries the same
     skill under "starga" and "local"; without this, a raw top-5 is
     effectively a top-3 distinct. Also drops `.system/` hub internals.
  3. THRESHOLD on score (MIND_NERVE_MIN_SCORE). Recalibrated — see below.
  4. (No margin gate: a Lowe's-ratio gate was specified, measured, and dropped
     — see APPLY_RATIO_GATE. The ratio is logged, never enforced.)
  5. PROJECT the surviving top-K hub skills as symlinks into the CLI's skills
     dir, so the CLI's skill announce stays ~2k chars instead of ~460k. The
     projection is a generation directory keyed by the hash of the route set,
     published by an atomic symlink flip; an unchanged set is zero work.
  6. INJECT `additionalContext` with the ranked routes, their ABSOLUTE
     SKILL.md / agent .md paths, and a mandatory-use instruction.
  7. LOG one telemetry line per decision so any of the above is measurable.

Fail-open is absolute: ANY error prints `{}` and exits 0. A broken router must
never block a prompt.

Configuration (all optional, all env):
  MIND_NERVE_SOCKET          UNIX socket of mind-nerve-routed
  MIND_NERVE_SOURCE_DIR      skills hub root
  MIND_NERVE_PROJECTED_DIR   per-CLI skills dir to rewrite
  MIND_NERVE_AGENT_DIRS      ':'-separated dirs of agent .md files
  MIND_NERVE_TOP_K           routes to inject/project after dedup (default 8)
  MIND_NERVE_MIN_SCORE       score floor (default 0.40, measured)
  MIND_NERVE_MIN_CONTENT_WORDS  intent-gate word floor (default 3)
  MIND_NERVE_INTENT_GATE     '0' disables the intent gate (default on)
  MIND_NERVE_PROJECT_MODE    'symlink' (default) | 'dir'
  MIND_NERVE_KEEP_GENERATIONS how many generation dirs to retain (default 3)
  MIND_NERVE_CORE_SKILLS     ','-separated always-projected skills
  MIND_NERVE_SOCKET_TIMEOUT  seconds (default 2.0)
  MIND_NERVE_LOG             JSONL log path
  MIND_NERVE_TELEMETRY       JSONL telemetry path
  MIND_NERVE_OVERFETCH       raw K requested from the daemon (default 80)
  MIND_NERVE_SESSION_BANNER_MINUTES  min minutes between SessionStart banners
                             (default 720; 0 = show on every SessionStart)
"""
